UNWIND [{_id:6878, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:146, numberOfRatingVotes:428521, name:"The Help", rating:8.0, description:"An aspiring author during the civil rights movement of the 1960s decides to write a book detailing the African American maids' point of view on the white families for which they work, and the hardships they go through on a daily basis.", id:"The Help", grossRevenue:169708112}}, {_id:6879, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:108, numberOfRatingVotes:902669, name:"Deadpool", rating:8.0, description:"A wisecracking mercenary gets experimented on and becomes immortal but ugly, and sets out to track down the man who ruined his looks.", id:"Deadpool", grossRevenue:363070709}}, {_id:6880, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:119, numberOfRatingVotes:45803, name:"Darbareye Elly", rating:8.0, description:"The mysterious disappearance of a kindergarten teacher during a picnic in the north of Iran is followed by a series of misadventures for her fellow travelers.", id:"Darbareye Elly", grossRevenue:106662}}, {_id:6881, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:144, numberOfRatingVotes:28749, name:"Dev.D", rating:8.0, description:"After breaking up with his childhood sweetheart, a young man finds solace in drugs. Meanwhile, a teenage girl is caught in the world of prostitution. Will they be destroyed, or will they find redemption?", id:"Dev.D", grossRevenue:10950}}, {_id:6882, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:106, numberOfRatingVotes:211427, name:"Yip Man", rating:8.0, description:"During the Japanese invasion of China, a wealthy martial artist is forced to leave his home when his city is occupied. With little means of providing for themselves, Ip Man and the remaining members of the city must find a way to survive.", id:"Yip Man"}}, {_id:6883, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:165, numberOfRatingVotes:98575, name:"My Name Is Khan", rating:8.0, description:"An Indian Muslim man with Asperger's syndrome takes a challenge to speak to the President of the United States seriously and embarks on a 