help AIDS patients get the medication they need after he is diagnosed with the disease.", id:"Dallas Buyers Club", grossRevenue:27298285}}, {_id:6891, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:117, numberOfRatingVotes:448930, name:"The Pursuit of Happyness", rating:8.0, description:"A struggling salesman takes custody of his son as he's poised to begin a life-changing professional career.", id:"The Pursuit of Happyness", grossRevenue:163566459}}, {_id:6892, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:143, numberOfRatingVotes:499439, name:"Blood Diamond", rating:8.0, description:"A fisherman, a smuggler, and a syndicate of businessmen match wits over the possession of a priceless diamond.", id:"Blood Diamond", grossRevenue:57366262}}, {_id:6893, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:115, numberOfRatingVotes:604694, name:"The Bourne Ultimatum", rating:8.0, description:"Jason Bourne dodges a ruthless C.I.A. official and his Agents from a new assassination program while searching for the origins of his life as a trained killer.", id:"The Bourne Ultimatum", grossRevenue:227471070}}, {_id:6894, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:88, numberOfRatingVotes:50610, name:"Bin-jip", rating:8.0, description:"A transient young man breaks into empty homes to partake of the vacationing residents' lives for a few days.", id:"Bin-jip", grossRevenue:238507}}, {_id:6895, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:124, numberOfRatingVotes:738512, name:"Sin City", rating:8.0, description:"A movie that explores the dark and miserable town, Basin City, tells the story of three different people, all caught up in violent corruption.", id:"Sin City", grossRevenue:74103820}}, {_id:6896, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:112, numberOfRatingVotes:103284, name:"Le scaphandre et le papillon", rating:8.0, description:"The true story of Elle editor Jean-Dominique Bauby who suffers a stroke and has to live with an almost totally paralyzed body; only his left eye isn't paralyzed.", id:"Le scaphandre et le papillon", grossRevenue:5990075}}, {_id:6897, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:127, numberOfRatingVotes:56960, name:"G.O.R.A.", rating:8.0, description:"A slick young Turk kidnapped by extraterrestrials shows his great « humanitarian spirit » by outwitting the evil commander-in-chief of the planet of G.O.R.A.", id:"G.O.R.A."}}] AS row
