o gather information about the man-made virus that wiped out most of the human population on the planet.", id:"Twelve Monkeys", grossRevenue:57141459}}, {_id:6925, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:83, numberOfRatingVotes:129231, rating:8.0, name:"Kôkaku Kidôtai", description:"A cyborg policewoman and her partner hunt a mysterious and powerful hacker called the Puppet Master.", id:"Kôkaku Kidôtai", grossRevenue:515905}}, {_id:6926, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:76, numberOfRatingVotes:300208, name:"The Nightmare Before Christmas", rating:8.0, description:"Jack Skellington, king of Halloween Town, discovers Christmas Town, but his attempts to bring Christmas to his home causes confusion.", id:"The Nightmare Before Christmas", grossRevenue:75082668}}, {_id:6927, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:101, numberOfRatingVotes:577991, name:"Groundhog Day", rating:8.0, description:"A weatherman finds himself inexplicably living the same day over and over again.", id:"Groundhog Day", grossRevenue:70906973}}, {_id:6928, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:180, numberOfRatingVotes:28825, name:"Bound by Honor", rating:8.0, description:"Based on the true life experiences of poet Jimmy Santiago Baca, the film focuses on step-brothers Paco and Cruz, and their bi-racial cousin Miklo.", id:"Bound by Honor", grossRevenue:4496583}}, {_id:6929, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:156, numberOfRatingVotes:263918, name:"Scent of a Woman", rating:8.0, description:"A prep school student needing money agrees to \"babysit\" a blind man, but the job is not at all what he anticipated.", id:"Scent of a Woman", grossRevenue:63895607}}, {_id:6930, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:90, numberOfRatingVotes:373845, name:"Aladdin", rating:8.0, description:"A kindhearted street urchin and a power-hungry Grand Vizier vie for a magic lamp that has the power to make their deepest wishes come true.", id:"Aladdin", grossRevenue:217350219}}, {_id:6931, properties:{runtimeInMinutes:189, numberOfRatingVotes:142110, name:"JFK", rating:8.0, d